{"title":"Berry/51","sourceTitle":"Berry/51/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Os arbustos maduros passam por quatro estágios de crescimento: maduros (vazios), floridos, maduros e maduros. Um arbusto recém-amadurecido ou colhido leva de 8 a 10 dias para começar a florescer, depois de 3 a 5 dias para dar frutos e, a seguir, de 8 a 10 dias para amadurecer para a colheita. Se a fruta madura não for colhida após 8 a 10 dias, o arbusto voltará automaticamente a ficar vazio.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115809\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.001 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.001 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183791-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115809 and revision id 397410. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397410,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Berry%2F51%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T11:58:10.007Z"}